 of "Winnie the Pooh".","title":"Roger Carel"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" He is also dubbing David Suchet as Hercule Poirot in Agatha Christie's Poirot.","title":"Roger Carel"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" He voiced Wally Gator, Mickey Mouse and Woody Woodpecker in French.","title":"Roger Carel"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" He was born in Paris, France.","title":"Roger Carel"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Dorothée Jemma (born June 16, 1956) is a French voice actress specializing in dubbing.","title":"Dorothée Jemma"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" She is the dub voice of Jennifer Aniston, Melanie Griffith and Sheryl Lee.","title":"Dorothée Jemma"}],"peer_messages":["Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Ethel Houbiers is a French voice actress.","title":"Ethel Houbiers"}
