n under her natural pen name Eliza Redgold.","title":"Elizabeth Reid Boyd"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" She defends the Romance novel as a form of feminism.","title":"Elizabeth Reid Boyd"}],"peer_messages":["ine (novel)"}
