politan Airport"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Low cost carrier terminal or LCCT a.k.a. budget terminal is a specific type of airport terminal designed with the needs of low cost airlines in mind.","title":"Low cost carrier terminal"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Though terminals may have differing charges and costs, as is common in Europe, the concept of an all budget terminal was promoted and pioneered by Tony Fernandes of AirAsia at Kuala Lumpur International Airport in 2006.","title":"Low cost carrier terminal"}],"peer_messages":["Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Spirit Airlines, Inc. (NASDAQ: SAVE ) is an American Ultra Low Cost Carrier, headquartered in Miramar, Florida.","title":"Spirit Airlines"}
